}

// --- feature grid ---

// Two breakpoints on one property, mobile-first: 1 column on phones,
// 2 from sm, 3 from lg. Needs a toolchain where media rules emit in
// ascending min-width order (fixed 2026-07-28) — older builds rendered
// the sm value on desktop.
